Error [E0112]: `get` wants fn(HTTPRequest) HTTPResponse !HTTPError for argument 2, but this is fn(HTTPRequest, HTTPRequest) HTTPResponse !HTTPError -[]>
  --> tests/ui/http_route_handler_arity.jet:10:21
    |
 10 |     mux.get("/bad", (first: HTTPRequest, second: HTTPRequest) -> Ok(server.response(200, first.path())))
